      578.1,
      547.18,
      631.26
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Welatantirige Don John Seneviratne, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powers vestedin me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amendedby Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes (Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968) hereby appointMr. R. S. Ariyapperuma, No. 03, Araliya Mawatha, Sirimal Uyana, Ratmalana to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him forsettlement by arbitration.",
